            <ArticleTitle>Usefulness of pharmacologic stress echocardiography in a chest pain center.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1247-50, A6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We tested the value of a stress echocardiography-based algorithm used in a chest pain center. The algorithm had superlative negative predictive value for cardiac events, allowing an early discharge.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
